      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a screenplay set in the Bronx around 1975. We're trying to get the atmosphere right for some background scenes. Could you give me a breakdown of what the typical 'street-level' inhabitants would have looked like and acted like back then? I want to make sure our character archetypes feel authentic to that gritty, urban vibe.",
